{#
  What `newsletter_form()` leaves in the page. js-helper's liveBlock() fetches
  the url on load and replaces this element with the form the live host renders,
  the way a conversation form is fetched — so the markup is built per visitor
  even on a page that was generated once, which is what lets it carry a token.
#}
<div class="newsletter-form-placeholder" data-live="{{ url }}"></div>
